                    "# Webhooks",
                    "",
                    "Each event is sent as a signed `POST` to the endpoint you register.",
                    "",
                    "## Verifying signatures",
                    "",
                    "Compare the `X-Signature` header with an HMAC of the raw body.",
                    "",
                    "## Retries",
                    "",
                    "A delivery that does not return `2xx` within 10 seconds is retried up to 8 times,",
                    "with exponential backoff starting at 30 seconds. Every retry carries the same",
